  "details": "When uploading avatars via multi-platform upload, if the avatars are children of a game object in the hierarchy, the build fails when it reaches another platform, and requires a restart of Unity to continue to upload. It also throws the error included below.\n\nRepro:\n\n1. Place Avatars for multiple platforms as children of an Empty Game Object\n\n2. Check all three build platforms\n\n3. Press Publish",
